# Formatting rules for monitor.
#
# Close to swiftformat's defaults so the diff stays small and the tool stays a
# check rather than a constant source of churn.

--swiftversion 6.0

--indent 4
--maxwidth 96

# Explicit self only where required.
--self remove

# Ranges without spaces: 0..<n matches prevailing Swift style.
--ranges nospace

# Rules deliberately disabled:
#
#   wrapFunctionBodies / wrapIfStatementBodies / wrapLoopBodies /
#   wrapPropertyBodies — one-line accessors, guards and helpers read better on
#                        one line, and the drawing code is full of them.
#   blankLinesAroundMark — MARK sections here often follow a doc comment.
--disable wrapFunctionBodies, blankLinesAroundMark, wrapIfStatementBodies, \
          wrapLoopBodies, wrapPropertyBodies

--exclude .build
